[h2]Build 0.9.8[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Conveyor lift[/b] (needs Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory): point a belt at a lift and its partner lift puts the items onto the conveyor in front of it. Lifts work both ways.
[*][b]As above, So below:[/b] a lift pairs by itself with a lift built on the same spot one level up or down, making a conveyor elevator between levels.
[*]Lifts can also be linked by hand to any other lift, which overrides the automatic pairing and works as a long-distance belt link without As above, So below.
[*]Conveyor arm networks follow belts through lifts, so a Loader on one level can feed a machine on another.
[/list]
